_LIDE v3.3 — the Latent Information Discovery Engine._
The specification and methodology (Skill.md) are the intellectual core of this
project. By using this framework, you agree to preserve the epistemic
discipline that makes LIDE what it is: never confuse what can be imagined
from an artifact with what is actually recoverable from it._